      "writtenOn": "2022-01-20T14:17:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After thinking about it a bit, I don\u0027t think the assert is necessary. The code should work, it\u0027ll just take a very long time. That said, there are two limits on it. In Ambient shadow generation, it\u0027s limited to 150. In Spot shadow generation, it\u0027s limited to whatever the radius of the light is, which in Android I believe is 800. For the directional light, the radius is a lot smaller.",
